{{Stonecutting
|Tuff; Polished Tuff|Tuff Bricks
}}

== Usage ==
=== Crafting ingredient ===
{{Crafting usage}}

=== Stonecutting ingredient ===
{{Stonecutting
|head=1
|Tuff Bricks
|Chiseled Tuff Bricks; Tuff Brick Slab, 2; Tuff Brick Stairs; Tuff Brick Wall
|foot=1
}}

=== Note blocks ===
Tuff bricks can be placed under [[note block]]s to produce "bass drum" sounds.

=== Sulfur cube ===
{{In development|section=1|drop=Chaos Cubed}}
[[Sulfur cube]]s have the ability to absorb tuff bricks, either through picking them up or being interacted with them. This provides the regular/football effect to the mob when hitting it.

